# Local run debris. These are produced by running the pipeline on a laptop and
# are not inputs to anything: staging is rebuilt every run, data/raw is
# refetched, and data/manual/current_odds.csv is a protected file that a
# `git add -A` must never sweep into a commit. It did once, on 2026-09-02,
# along with provider responses whose 32-hex event ids look enough like an API
# key to trip the secrets guard - which is how it was caught.
data/staging/
data/raw/understat_league_EPL_*.json
data/manual/current_odds.csv
